Description: Reference-informed Bayesian inference of individual-level cell-type expression
    and RNA fractions from bulk RNA sequencing, with optional prediction and
    prioritization of recoverable gene-cell-type expression profiles.
    A generalized additive model scores expected expression recoverability.
    Benchmarking utilities evaluate recovery against known component counts
    and report the coverage of prioritized profiles.
